         this.strings["frm_Travel6_extra_0"] = "Right about here is where Hork Nicolson (Dred\'s father) was assassinated.";
         this.strings["frm_Travel6_extra_1"] = "This is where the Imperial Mental Institution is located";
         this.strings["frm_Travel6_extra_2"] = "This is where Dred Nicolson got bitten while hunting his first space snake";
         this.strings["frm_Travel6_extra_3"] = "I don\'t recommend venturing in that direction if you value your life -->";
         this.strings["frm_Travel6_extra_4"] = "This is the spot where Lily Slimwagon ate his first slice of lemon pudding.";
         this.strings["frm_Travel6_extra_5"] = ".<-- Don\'t ask me what that dot is. I think it\'s a flaw in your monitor.";
         this.strings["frm_Travel6_extra_6"] = "<-- Way out there is where Mono Cheezo got lost.";
         this.strings["frm_Travel6_extra_7"] = "Right about here is where Mr. Zinn made his first kubar selling bool nuts to a band of travelling monks.";
         this.strings["frm_Travel6_extra_8"] = "This is where Emperor Dred\'s ex-wife lives";
         this.strings["frm_Travel6_extra_9"] = "This is where Emperor Bass Nicolson defeated the Hapa Jillos";
         this.strings["frm_Travel6_extra_10"] = "This is where Mono Cheezo claims to have lost his memory";
         this.strings["frm_Travel6_extra_11"] = "This is where Lily Slimwagon ran out of gas.";
         this.strings["frm_Travel6_extra_12"] = "Right here is where Mr. Zinn wants to construct a chain of orbiting pay toilets for travellers who can\'t wait to land. -->";
         this.strings["frm_Travel6_extra_13"] = "Legend has it that something interesting must have happened here, but nobody is sure exactly what that something is.";
         this.strings["frm_Tutorial_complexity_label_1"] = "Tutorial Completed: ";
         this.strings["frm_Tutorial_complexity_label_2"] = "%";
         this.strings["frm_Tutorial_button_more"] = "Add New Feature";
         this.strings["frm_Tutorial_text_1_1"] = "<p align=\'center\'><font size=\'+5\'><b>Welcome to the Tutorial!</b></font></p>\nThe game will start off simple and gradually become more sophisticated.  Once you learn the basic rules, we will allow you to add features at your own pace.\n\nYou begin the game with ";
         this.strings["frm_Tutorial_text_1_1_multiplayer"] = "<p align=\'center\'><font size=\'+5\'><b>Welcome to the Tutorial!</b></font></p>\nThe game will start off simple and gradually become more sophisticated.\n\nYou begin the game with ";
         this.strings["frm_Tutorial_text_1_2"] = " in cash and a debt of ";
         this.strings["frm_Tutorial_text_1_3"] = " kubars to Mr. Zinn.\n\nThe best way to familiarize yourself with the game is to click on the <b>Getting Started</b> button on the Main Menu.";
         this.strings["frm_Tutorial_text_2"] = "<p align=\'center\'><font size=\'+5\'><b>Tutorial!</b></font></p>\nThis turn we are introducing a new feature called <b>Zinn\'s Loan</b>.  In order to purchase your spaceship, you took out a loan from Mr. Zinn.  Now you must begin to pay Mr. Zinn back.\n\nMr. Zinn charges <b>4%</b> interest per week.  It takes one week to travel to a new planet and conduct business.  In other words, one week equals one game turn.";
         this.strings["frm_Tutorial_text_3"] = "<p align=\'center\'><font size=\'+5\'><b>Tutorial!</b></font></p>\nThis turn we are introducing a new feature called <b>Supply</b>.  The Supply Chart shows the supply of goods on each planet.\n\nIf the supply is 100%, the commodities are plentiful and the price tends to be low.  If the supply is 0%, the goods are rare, and the price tends to be high.  This should help you determine which planet is worth traveling to.";
         this.strings["frm_Tutorial_text_4"] = "<p align=\'center\'><font size=\'+5\'><b>Tutorial!</b></font></p>\nThis turn we are introducing a new feature called <b>Loan</b>.  This allows you to borrow money from the Traders\' Union.";
         this.strings["frm_Tutorial_text_5"] = "<p align=\'center\'><font size=\'+5\'><b>Tutorial!</b></font></p>\nThis turn we are introducing a new feature called <b>Voyager\'s Insurance</b>.  Now you can buy insurance to protect your company from unforeseen disasters.\n\nBe sure to click on the <b>Help</b> button on the Insurance screen for more information!";
         this.strings["frm_Tutorial_text_6"] = "<p align=\'center\'><font size=\'+5\'><b>Tutorial!</b></font></p>\nThis turn we are introducing a new feature called <b>View City</b>.\n\nThis feature allows you to look at the city you are visiting and read about the planet\'s history.";
         this.strings["frm_Tutorial_text_7_first_time"] = "<p align=\'center\'><font size=\'+5\'><b>Tutorial!</b></font></p>\nThis turn we are introducing a new feature called <b>Fuel</b>.  Now you <b>must</b> buy fuel for your spaceship.";
         this.strings["frm_Tutorial_text_7"] = "<p align=\'center\'><font size=\'+5\'><b>Tutorial!</b></font></p>\nFrom this point onwards, you must decide when to add new features to the game.\n\nJust click on the <b>Add New Feature</b> button below, and <b>Passengers</b> will be added to the game.\n\nIf you wish to wait until later to add this feature, just click on <b>Continue</b>.";
         this.strings["frm_Tutorial_text_7_multiplayer"] = "<p align=\'center\'><font size=\'+5\'><b>Tutorial!</b></font></p>\nThis turn we are introducing a new feature called <b>Fuel</b>.  Now you <b>must</b> buy fuel for your spaceship.";
         this.strings["frm_Tutorial_text_8"] = "<p align=\'center\'><font size=\'+5\'><b>Tutorial!</b></font></p>\nSince you added <b>Passengers</b> to the game, you can make money transporting passengers from one planet to another.\n\nThe next feature you can add is <b>Crew</b>.";
         this.strings["frm_Tutorial_text_8_multiplayer"] = "<p align=\'center\'><font size=\'+5\'><b>Tutorial!</b></font></p>\nThis turn we are introducing a new feature called <b>Passengers</b>.  This allows you to make money transporting passengers from one planet to another.";
         this.strings["frm_Tutorial_text_9"] = "<p align=\'center\'><font size=\'+5\'><b>Tutorial!</b></font></p>\nSince you added <b>Crew</b> to the game, you must pay your ship\'s crew a salary.\n\nThe next feature you can add is <b>Advertising</b>.";
         this.strings["frm_Tutorial_text_9_multiplayer"] = "<p align=\'center\'><font size=\'+5\'><b>Tutorial!</b></font></p>\nThis turn we are introducing a new feature called <b>Crew</b>.  This means you must pay your ship\'s crew a salary.";
         this.strings["frm_Tutorial_text_10"] = "<p align=\'center\'><font size=\'+5\'><b>Tutorial!</b></font></p>\nSince you added <b>Advertising</b> to the game, you can advertise for your business and get more passengers and cargo.\n\nThe next feature you can add is <b>Taxes</b>.";
         this.strings["frm_Tutorial_text_10_multiplayer"] = "<p align=\'center\'><font size=\'+5\'><b>Tutorial!</b></font></p>\nThis turn we are introducing a new feature called <b>Advertising</b>.  You can now advertise for your business and get more passengers and cargo.";
         this.strings["frm_Tutorial_text_11"] = "<p align=\'center\'><font size=\'+5\'><b>Tutorial!</b></font></p>\nSince you added <b>Taxes</b> to the game, you must pay taxes for your business.  Sorry, but that\'s life.\n\nThe next feature you can add is <b>Bank</b>.";
         this.strings["frm_Tutorial_text_11_multiplayer"] = "<p align=\'center\'><font size=\'+5\'><b>Tutorial!</b></font></p>\nThis turn we are introducing a new feature called <b>Taxes</b>.  This means you must pay taxes for your business.  Sorry, but that\'s life.";
         this.strings["frm_Tutorial_text_12"] = "<p align=\'center\'><font size=\'+5\'><b>Tutorial!</b></font></p>\nSince you added <b>Bank</b> to the game, you can deposit money in a Savings Account.\n\nThe next feature you can add is <b>Warehouse</b>.";
         this.strings["frm_Tutorial_text_12_multiplayer"] = "<p align=\'center\'><font size=\'+5\'><b>Tutorial!</b></font></p>This turn we are introducing a new feature called <b>Bank</b>.  You can now deposit money in a savings account and earn interest.";
         this.strings["frm_Tutorial_text_13"] = "<p align=\'center\'><font size=\'+5\'><b>Tutorial!</b></font></p>\nSince you added <b>Warehouse</b> to the game, you can store commodities in warehouses on all seven planets.\n\nWhen visiting the Warehouse screen, be sure to click on <b>Help</b> for more information.\n\nThe next feature you can add is <b>Explore Planets</b>.";
         this.strings["frm_Tutorial_text_13_multiplayer"] = "<p align=\'center\'><font size=\'+5\'><b>Tutorial!</b></font></p>\nThis turn we are introducing <b>Warehouses</b>.  You can now store commodities in warehouses on all seven planets.\n\nWhen visiting the Warehouse screen, be sure to click on the <b>Help</b> button for more information.";
         this.strings["frm_Tutorial_text_14"] = "<p align=\'center\'><font size=\'+5\'><b>Tutorial!</b></font></p>\nSince you added <b>Explore Planets</b> to the game, you can explore the planets, get weather updates, and follow the local news.\n\nThe next feature you can add is <b>Distance Chart</b>.";
         this.strings["frm_Tutorial_text_14_multiplayer"] = "<p align=\'center\'><font size=\'+5\'><b>Tutorial!</b></font></p>\nThis turn we are introducing a new feature called <b>Explore Planets</b>.\n\nYou can now explore the planets, get weather updates, and follow the local news.";
         this.strings["frm_Tutorial_text_15"] = "<p align=\'center\'><font size=\'+5\'><b>Tutorial!</b></font></p>\nSince you added <b>Distance Chart</b> to the game, you can see the exact distance between each planet and the locations of your competitors\' ships.\n\nThe Distance Chart button is located at the bottom of the galaxy map.\n\nThe next feature you can add is <b>Facilities</b>.";
         this.strings["frm_Tutorial_text_15_multiplayer"] = "<p align=\'center\'><font size=\'+5\'><b>Tutorial!</b></font></p>\nThis turn we are introducing a new feature called <b>Distance Chart</b>.\n\nThis chart shows the distance between each of the planets and the locations of your competitors\' ships.\n\nThe Distance Chart button is located at the bottom of the galaxy map.";
         this.strings["frm_Tutorial_text_16"] = "<p align=\'center\'><font size=\'+3\'><b>Tutorial!</b></font></p>\nSince you added <b>Facilities</b> to the game, Emperor Dred Nicolson will auction off government facilities to the highest bidder.  The company that buys a facility can charge other trading companies a <b>Fee</b> every time they visit the planet where the facility is located.\n\nThe Facilities button appears right next to the Distance Chart button at the bottom of the galaxy map.\n\nThe next feature you can add is <b>Stock Markets</b>.";
         this.strings["frm_Tutorial_text_16_multiplayer"] = "<p align=\'center\'><font size=\'+3\'><b>Tutorial!</b></font></p>\nThis turn we are introducing a new feature called <b>Facilities</b>.\n\nOnce every few weeks, Emperor Dred Nicolson will auction off government facilities to the highest bidder.  The company that buys a facility can charge other trading companies a <b>Fee</b> every time they visit the planet where the facility is located.\n\nThe Facilities button appears right next to the Distance Chart button at the bottom of the galaxy map.";
         this.strings["frm_Tutorial_text_17"] = "<p align=\'center\'><font size=\'+3\'><b>Tutorial Completed!</b></font></p>\nCongratulations, you have reached the end of the Tutorial.  The final feature called <b>Stock Markets</b> has been added to the game.\n\nWe have also added <b>Shortcuts</b> to the game under the <b>File Options</b> screen.  This will help speed up the game!";
         this.strings["frm_Tutorial_text_17_multiplayer"] = "<p align=\'center\'><font size=\'+3\'><b>Tutorial Completed!</b></font></p>\nCongratulations, you have reached the end of the Tutorial.  The final feature called <b>Stock Markets</b> has been added to the game.\n\nWe have also added <b>Shortcuts</b> to the game under the <b>File Options</b> screen.  This will help speed up the game!";
