         this.strings["frm_MainMenu_help_tutorial"] = "The <b>Main Menu</b> (which is the screen you are at) is the heart of the game.  From this menu you can access every major sub-menu.\n\nIf you are a first-time player and want help learning the game, try clicking on the <b>Getting Started</b> button.\n\nIf you want to save your game, quit or start a new game, click on the <b>File Options</b> button.\n\nIn addition, most sub-menus contain a context-sensitive <b>Help</b> button.  If you have any questions, just click on the <b>Help</b> buttons, and they should explain each menu in more detail.";
         this.strings["frm_MainMenu_help"] = "The <b>Main Menu</b> is the heart of the game.  From this menu you can access every major sub-menu.\n\nIf you want to save your game, quit or start a new game, click on the <b>File Options</b> button.\n\nIn addition, most sub-menus contain a context-sensitive <b>Help</b> button.  If you have any questions, just click on the <b>Help</b> buttons, and they should explain each menu in more detail.";
         this.strings["frm_MainMenu_getting_started_1"] = "1)  Your goal is to build a successful business trading commodities between the 7 planets of Kukubia.\n\n2)  To begin with, you must go to the <b>Marketplace</b> and buy the commodities which are at a low price.";
         this.strings["frm_MainMenu_getting_started_2"] = "3)  Once your ship is filled with cargo, you are ready to leave.  Go to <b>Journey</b> and click on the planet you wish to travel to.\n\n4)  When you arrive on the new planet, go to <b>Marketplace</b>.  If the <b>Market Price</b> is higher than the price <b>You Paid</b>, you can sell your goods for a profit.";
