         this.strings["frm_Stock_not_present_1"] = "Sorry, but you cannot buy or sell shares on the ";
         this.strings["frm_Stock_not_present_2"] = " Exchange.\n\nYou must be visiting the planet to buy or sell its shares.";
         this.strings["frm_Stock_already_bought"] = "You already purchased shares this week.\n\nIf you want to buy more shares, you must come back another week.";
         this.strings["frm_Stock_not_enough_cash_for_one"] = "You may not purchase any shares at this time.\n\nThe Stock Exchange has a strict set of regulations, which permit no one company to invest more than 1% of its money (or 10,000 kubars, whichever is more) in one week.\n\nThis trade regulation is designed to prevent rampant speculation, which has the potential to destabilize the market.\n\nUnfortunately, just one share would exceed this limit.";
         this.strings["frm_Stock_buy_how_many"] = "<p align=\'center\'><b>Buy Shares</b></p>\nEnter the number of shares you wish to purchase.";
         this.strings["frm_Stock_buy_too_many_1"] = "The ";
         this.strings["frm_Stock_buy_too_many_2"] = " Stock Exchange has refused to allow you to purchase ";
         this.strings["frm_Stock_buy_too_many_3"] = " shares of stock.\n\nThe Stock Exchange has a strict set of regulations, which permit no one company to invest more than 1% of its money (or 10,000 kubars, whichever is more) in one week.  This trade regulation is designed to prevent rampant speculation, which has the potential to destabilize the market.\n\nThe maximum number of shares you can purchase this week is <b>";
         this.strings["frm_Stock_buy_too_many_4"] = "</b>.  If you still want to purchase stock, please click <b>Buy</b> again.";
         this.strings["frm_Stock_buy_commission_1"] = "Every time you buy or sell stock, you must pay your broker a <b>1%</b> commission.  This comes out to be a total of <b>";
         this.strings["frm_Stock_buy_commission_2"] = " kubars</b>.\n\nSorry, but brokers do not work for free.";
         this.strings["frm_Stock_no_shares"] = "You don\'t own any shares on this stock exchage.";
         this.strings["frm_Stock_sell_how_many_loss_1"] = "<p align=\'center\'><b>Sell Shares</b></p>\nEnter the number of shares you wish to sell.\n\nIf you sell all of your shares right now, you stand to make a <font color=\'#F05555\'><b>loss</b></font> of <font color=\'#F05555\'><b>";
         this.strings["frm_Stock_sell_how_many_loss_2"] = "</b></font> kubars on top of the brokerage fees.";
         this.strings["frm_Stock_sell_how_many_profit_1"] = "<p align=\'center\'><b>Sell Shares</b></p>\nEnter the number of shares you wish to sell.\n\nIf you sell all of your shares right now, you stand to make a <font color=\'#227BFF\'><b>profit</b></font> of <font color=\'#227BFF\'><b>";
         this.strings["frm_Stock_sell_how_many_profit_2"] = "</b></font> kubars less the brokerage fees.";
         this.strings["frm_Stock_not_enough_shares"] = "You don\'t own that many shares.";
         this.strings["frm_Stock_sell_profit_1"] = "Congratulations, you made a profit of <font color=\'#227BFF\'><b>";
         this.strings["frm_Stock_sell_profit_2"] = "</b></font> kubars!\n\nAnd now you must pay a brokerage fee.  Every time you buy or sell stock, you must pay your broker a <b>1%</b> commission on the total transaction amount (";
         this.strings["frm_Stock_sell_profit_3"] = " kubars), and this time, the commission comes out to be <b>";
         this.strings["frm_Stock_sell_profit_4"] = "</b> kubars.\n\nSorry, but brokers do not work for free.";
         this.strings["frm_Stock_sell_neutral_1"] = "You <b>broke even</b> with a profit of exactly <b>";
         this.strings["frm_Stock_sell_neutral_2"] = "</b> kubars!\n\nDespite the fact that you didn\'t make any money, you must still pay a brokerage fee.  Every time you buy or sell stock, you must pay your broker a <b>1%</b> commission on the total transaction amount (";
         this.strings["frm_Stock_sell_neutral_3"] = " kubars), and this time, the commission comes out to be <b>";
         this.strings["frm_Stock_sell_neutral_4"] = "</b> kubars.\n\nSorry, but brokers do not work for free.";
         this.strings["frm_Stock_sell_loss_1"] = "I\'m sorry to say you suffered a loss of <font color=\'#F05555\'><b>";
         this.strings["frm_Stock_sell_loss_2"] = "</b></font> kubars!\n\nDespite the fact that you lost money, you must still pay a brokerage fee.  Every time you buy or sell stock, you must pay your broker a <b>1%</b> commission on the total transaction amount (";
         this.strings["frm_Stock_sell_loss_3"] = " kubars), and this time, the commission comes out to be <b>";
         this.strings["frm_Stock_sell_loss_4"] = "</b> kubars.\n\nSorry, but brokers do not work for free.";
         this.strings["frm_Stock_show_shares_head"] = "<p align=\'center\'><b>Your Shares On Each Planet</b></p>\n          ";
         this.strings["frm_Stock_show_shares_repeat"] = "\n          ";
         this.strings["frm_Stock_help_1_1"] = "Each planet has its own stock exchange.  These stock exchanges are similar to index funds.  They are an average of selected stocks on each planet.\n\nWhile visiting ";
         this.strings["frm_Stock_help_1_2"] = ", you may either buy or sell shares on the ";
         this.strings["frm_Stock_help_1_3"] = " Exchange.  If you wish to buy or sell shares on the other exchanges, you must travel to the planet where the exchange is located.";
         this.strings["frm_Stock_help_2"] = "Emperor Dred has enacted a strict set of regulations.  First of all, each company gets only one chance per week to purchase stock.  Secondly, no one company may invest more than 1% of its money (or 10,000 kubars, whichever is more) in one week.\n\nThese regulations are designed to prevent rampant speculation, which has the potential to destabilize the market.";
         this.strings["frm_Stock_help_3"] = "The stock market operates according to trends.  When you invest, you should be watching for bull markets and bear markets.\n\nIf an upward trend starts, it naturally gains momentum every time the market rises.  However, if the market takes a dip, that could trigger the start of a downward trend.  As an investor, you want to spot an upward trend and invest heavily, then just as a downward trend kicks in, you should sell your shares.";
         this.strings["frm_Stock_help_4"] = "Also, be sure to take note when the stock market falls too low.  If the market hits zero, this signals a crash, and you will lose your entire investment\n\nLast but not least, every time you buy or sell stock, you must pay your broker a 1% commission.  Sorry, but brokers don\'t work for free.";
         this.strings["frm_Money_button_graph"] = "Graph";
         this.strings["frm_Money_button_opponents_1"] = "Computer Players";
         this.strings["frm_Money_button_opponents_2"] = "My Company";
         this.strings["frm_Money_button_shipinfo"] = "Ship Info";
         this.strings["frm_Money_op_text"] = "There are six computer controlled opponents you are competing with.";
         this.strings["frm_Money_text_0a"] = "Company Name";
         this.strings["frm_Money_text_1a"] = "Game Difficulty Level";
         this.strings["frm_Money_text_2a"] = "Net Worth <font size=\'-4\'>(at the start of the week)</font>";
         this.strings["frm_Money_text_3a"] = "Net Worth <font size=\'-4\'>(right now)</font>";
         this.strings["frm_Money_text_4a"] = "Company Status";
         this.strings["frm_Money_help_1"] = "The standard currency in Kukubia is the kubar.  In order to win the game, your company must attain a <b>net worth</b> of <b>";
         this.strings["frm_Money_help_2"] = " kubars</b>.\n\nYour net worth is computed by adding together your cash, savings and stock, then subtracting any money you owe the Traders\' Union and Mr. Zinn.";
         this.strings["frm_ShipInfo_model_1"] = "Model:  Stinger XII";
         this.strings["frm_ShipInfo_model_2"] = "Model:  Fly Catcher";
