         this.strings["frm_ZinnLoan_help_1_1"] = "Mr. Zinn is a wealthy and somewhat fickle financier.  He made his fortune as a merchant on Zile, and now he increases his wealth by investing in other businesses.\n\nMr. Zinn is willing to lend you money at <b>";
         this.strings["frm_ZinnLoan_help_1_2"] = "%</b> interest per week.  The interest is charged every time you leave a planet and travel to a new planet, and this amount is added to your total debt.";
