         this.strings["frm_SaveGame_autosave"] = "<p align=\'center\'><font size=\'+5\'><b>Auto Save</b></font></p>\nWe have incorporated an <b>auto save</b> feature into Zapitalism.\n\nIf you save this game once, the <b>auto save</b> feature will be activated for the current game.  This way you don\'t have to worry about saving this particular game ever again.\n\nThe computer will automatically save the game when you load another game, start a new game, or start a new turn.";
