         this.strings["frm_Travel2_bad_event_11_6_insurance"] = " kubars</b></font> to have it repaired.\n\nLuckily you have <font color=\'#77D7FF\'><b>Voyagers\' Insurance!</b></font>  Your insurance reimburses you in full and replaces damaged items.";
         this.strings["frm_Travel2_bad_event_11_7a"] = "Pummeled";
         this.strings["frm_Travel2_bad_event_11_7b"] = "You stumble into a stellar typhoon, and it pounds your ship.  Your rear thrusters are nearly torn apart, and you must pay <font color=\'#F05555\'><b>";
